# Store and check out LF everywhere: the working tree is LF today and every
# consumer here (Node, PowerShell, cmd, YAML) accepts LF. This keeps the index
# byte-stable and avoids CRLF/LF churn regardless of the machine that clones.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Third-party binary is ignored (see bin/README.md), but never treat it as text.
*.exe binary
*.png binary
